Seen Mark Viera on "30 Rock"? Houston, you’re in for a treat. Mark brings his Bronx roots to life with stories that feel like home. Energetic and real, his comedy is all about family and the absurd moments we all know. It's like catching up with a funny old friend. Punch Line Houston · Thursday, April 9, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring. 

